        ; Builds the receiver-dropped argument list in ITS OWN frame and
        ; resolves the this-implicit overload; the caller's namespace-mangling
        ; block then rebuilds the namespaced mangled name. Kept whole here so
        ; collapse_operand_sequence# adds no locals (its s178 alloca pool
        ; mis-aliases any added there — see the call site).
