        ; overload resolution: exact matches first, then compatible
        ; (widened), then generic instantiation. 'this' parameters are
        ; implicitly skipped.
        ;
        ; Returns null when no overload matches; callers fall back to a
        ; fresh type variable so the constraint solver can recover.
        ; ================================================================
        ; Bind a generic function's parameters to an EXPLICIT type-argument
        ; list and monomorphise it. Mirrors the inferred path (the
        ; instantiate_generic_function call in lookup_method#) in every respect
        ; but where the bindings come from.
