        ; parameter's state (its R8 mask), it is handed state of ours at such a
        ; position -- `this`, a field of it, a parameter -- and this routine has
        ; no caller page: R8 could not
        ; follow this call (a receiver typed by a generic parameter, say), so
        ; the values would land on this frame and the receiver would keep them
